"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"code":"OUDSTheme","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pin code input"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with raw and semantic tokens of dimensions (from "},{"code":"AllDimensionSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and spaces (from "},{"code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemepincodeinputcomponenttokensprovider","kind":"symbol","title":"OrangeThemePinCodeInputComponentTokensProvider","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemePinCodeInputComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemePinCodeInputComponentTokensProvider","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemePinCodeInputComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}]},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}],"identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","type":"image","alt":null},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemePinCodeInputComponentTokensProvider/sizeMaxWidth":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token dimensions._3xlarge (= 56)"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemepincodeinputcomponenttokensprovider\/sizemaxwidth","kind":"symbol","title":"sizeMaxWidth","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemePinCodeInputComponentTokensProvider\/sizeMaxWidth","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sizeMaxWidth","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SizeSemanticTok